[11-Mar-2026 15:41:07 +0000]: <22r9b3sc> [D2BF] S: <html><div>
<p>Hi&nbsp;Raden,&nbsp;</p>
<p>This is Ethel from the Google Workspace for Education Approvals Team. Thank you for reaching out to inquire about your eligibility for Google Workspace for Education. We&rsquo;re currently experiencing a high volume of applications, and eligibility decisions are taking longer than usual. If you have a local partner or Google sales point of contact, please work with them to explore your options in the interim. In the meantime, please contact the Support team for the extension of your trial period while your approval application is pending.</p>
<p>Contact the Support team via one of the methods outlined at <a href="https://support.google.com/a/answer/1047213">https://support.google.com/a/answer/1047213</a></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Best Regards</p>
Ethel&nbsp;<br>Google Workspace for Education Approval Team</div><img alt="" src="https://vector.my.salesforce.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?oid=00Df40000023Flu&esid=018Kf00000RbWdO&from=ext"></html>
